## Ignore build output
bin/
obj/

## Ignore Visual Studio files
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Ignore VS Code settings
.vscode/

## Ignore Rider IDE files
.idea/

## ASP.NET / Blazor cache
**/wwwroot/css/*.map
**/wwwroot/js/*.map

## Logs
*.log

## NuGet packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.nuspec
packages/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## Cache and temp files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## .NET-specific ignore
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
*.lock.json

## Build configuration files
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json

## User-specific secrets (if using Secret Manager)
secrets.json

## Resharper files
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper

## Godot C# (if exporting or mixing)
.mono/
GodotSharp/

## Optional: ignore publish output
publish/
